      "side": 1,
      "message": "this dependency relationship seems a little off to me. do we only want to enable this when we\u0027re building all 3 into the kernel? i.e., what if we only want to build CRYPTO_LIB_AES and CRYPTO_LIB_SHA256? wouldn\u0027t we still want them to be overridden?",
      "revId": "5885de1ffa1724f7f55d120d34067c2720fe75bb",
